  "notes": "12-step gray scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: grayA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/gray.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/gray-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --gray-1: #fcfcfc;\n  --gray-2: #f9f9f9;\n  --gray-3: #f0f0f0;\n  --gray-4: #e8e8e8;\n  --gray-5: #e0e0e0;\n  --gray-6: #d9d9d9;\n  --gray-7: #cecece;\n  --gray-8: #bbbbbb;\n  --gray-9: #8d8d8d;\n  --gray-10: #838383;\n  --gray-11: #646464;\n  --gray-12: #202020;\n}\n.dark {\n  --gray-1: #111111;\n  --gray-2: #191919;\n  --gray-3: #222222;\n  --gray-4: #2a2a2a;\n  --gray-5: #313131;\n  --gray-6: #3a3a3a;\n  --gray-7: #484848;\n  --gray-8: #606060;\n  --gray-9: #6e6e6e;\n  --gray-10: #7b7b7b;\n  --gray-11: #b4b4b4;\n  --gray-12: #eeeeee;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix gray</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fcfcfc\" title=\"--gray-1: #fcfcfc\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#f9f9f9\" title=\"--gray-2: #f9f9f9\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#f0f0f0\" title=\"--gray-3: #f0f0f0\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#e8e8e8\" title=\"--gray-4: #e8e8e8\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#e0e0e0\" title=\"--gray-5: #e0e0e0\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#d9d9d9\" title=\"--gray-6: #d9d9d9\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#cecece\" title=\"--gray-7: #cecece\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#bbbbbb\" title=\"--gray-8: #bbbbbb\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#8d8d8d\" title=\"--gray-9: #8d8d8d\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#838383\" title=\"--gray-10: #838383\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#646464\" title=\"--gray-11: #646464\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#202020\" title=\"--gray-12: #202020\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#111111\" title=\"--gray-1: #111111\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#191919\" title=\"--gray-2: #191919\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#222222\" title=\"--gray-3: #222222\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#2a2a2a\" title=\"--gray-4: #2a2a2a\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#313131\" title=\"--gray-5: #313131\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#3a3a3a\" title=\"--gray-6: #3a3a3a\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#484848\" title=\"--gray-7: #484848\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#606060\" title=\"--gray-8: #606060\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#6e6e6e\" title=\"--gray-9: #6e6e6e\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#7b7b7b\" title=\"--gray-10: #7b7b7b\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#b4b4b4\" title=\"--gray-11: #b4b4b4\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#eeeeee\" title=\"--gray-12: #eeeeee\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
